{
  "_README": "Ruleset Juknis SKK Migas — sumber kebenaran tunggal untuk validasi kepatuhan onboarding KKKS (/adapter/validate) DAN wizard Setup Juknis. v1 INI DIISI DARI IMPLEMENTASI BE NYATA (gx-space): apply.py (atribut+geometri+klasifikasi), masking.py (aturan L3/L4), dan AUDIT_Atribut_SIGI_vs_Schema.md. Field 'pending_*' menandai keputusan tata-kelola SKK Migas yang BELUM final (penamaan UPPERCASE SIGI/PPDM, set field SIGI penuh, sub-tipe fasilitas) — diisi/diratifikasi tim domain.",
  "ruleset_version": "1.0.0",
  "juknis_reference": {
    "document": "Petunjuk Teknis SPEKTRUM IOG 4.0 — Dokumen SIGI",
    "sections": "§3.1–3.6, Tabel 2–16",
    "version": "IOG 4.0",
    "issued_by": "SKK Migas",
    "source_doc": "Petunjuk Teknis SPEKTRUM IOG 4.0.pdf (gx-space/version_feature_connector)",
    "be_source_of_truth": "gxspace/.../policy_contract/juknis/apply.py (JUKNIS_VERSION 1.0.0)"
  },
  "global_rules": {
    "crs_required": "EPSG:4326",
    "service_protocol": ["OGC_API_FEATURES"],
    "default_retention_years": 5,
    "classification_levels": {
      "L0": { "label": "PUBLIK (penuh)", "access_type": "PUBLIC", "published_to_spektrum": true, "masked": false },
      "L1": { "label": "PUBLIK (terbatas)", "access_type": "PUBLIC", "published_to_spektrum": true, "masked": false },
      "L2": { "label": "INTERNAL", "access_type": "PRIVATE", "published_to_spektrum": true, "masked": false },
      "L3": { "label": "TERBATAS/KONFIDENSIAL", "access_type": "PRIVATE", "published_to_spektrum": true, "masked": true },
      "L4": { "label": "RAHASIA", "access_type": "PRIVATE", "published_to_spektrum": false, "masked": true }
    },
    "masking": {
      "L3": {
        "coordinate_decimals": 2,
        "drop_attributes": ["kb_elevation", "total_depth", "tahun_akuisisi", "tahun_temuan"]
      },
      "L4": {
        "coordinate_decimals": 1,
        "keep_only_attributes": ["wk_id", "uwi", "field_id", "facility_id", "survey_id", "nama_sumur", "nama_lapangan", "nama_fasilitas", "nama_survei", "nama_wk", "operator"]
      }
    },
    "pending_governance_decisions": [
      "Konvensi penamaan field: adopsi nama SIGI UPPERCASE (selaras PPDM, mis. WK_ID/NAMA_WK) ATAU pertahankan lowercase + simpan SIGI/PPDM sebagai alias.",
      "Subset Mandatory untuk publish ke SPEKTRUM: tentukan field SIGI mana yang wajib vs opsional (SIGI menandai Mandatory per field).",
      "Model Fasilitas: 1 schema generik (jenis_fasilitas enum) ATAU 8 sub-tipe SIGI (PIPELINE_LN/PLATFORM_PT/...).",
      "Seismik: adopsi nama PPDM SEIS_ACQTN_* dan pisah Area vs Line.",
      "Pembagian PJ input (Field SK SKK Migas): field mana diisi SKK vs KKKS."
    ]
  },
  "attribute_type_enum": ["string", "integer", "number", "boolean", "date", "datetime"],
  "geometry_type_enum": ["Point", "MultiPoint", "LineString", "MultiLineString", "Polygon", "MultiPolygon"],
  "domains": [
    {
